{
  "$schema": "../schema/component.schema.json",
  "id": "focus",
  "title": "聚焦",
  "description": "用于句子逐词聚焦、其余单词模糊并带边框动画的文字强调组件。",
  "category": "effect",
  "tags": [
    "css",
    "tailwind",
    "codepen"
  ],
  "platforms": [
    "web"
  ],
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "sentence",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "要逐词展示和动画的句子。",
      "default": "\"reborn Focus\""
    },
    {
      "name": "manualMode",
      "type": "boolean",
      "required": false,
      "description": "若为 `true`，悬停时才高亮；否则自动循环。",
      "default": "false"
    },
    {
      "name": "blurAmount",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "非聚焦单词的模糊半径（像素）。",
      "default": "5"
    },
    {
      "name": "borderColor",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "动画聚焦边框的颜色。",
      "default": "\"green\""
    },
    {
      "name": "animationDuration",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "聚焦框动画过渡的持续时间（秒）。",
      "default": "0.5"
    },
    {
      "name": "pauseBetweenAnimations",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "自动聚焦之间的暂停时长（秒）。",
      "default": "1"
    }
  ],
  "events": [],
  "slots": [],
  "exposes": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Web 演示",
      "code": "<template>\r\n  <Focus\r\n    sentence=\"Focus is the key\"\r\n    :manual-mode=\"false\"\r\n    :blur-amount=\"5\"\r\n    border-color=\"red\"\r\n    :animation-duration=\"1\"\r\n    :pause-between-animations=\"0.5\"\r\n  />\r\n</template>\r\n",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web"
    },
    {
      "title": "Web 演示",
      "code": "<template>\r\n  <div class=\"relative flex h-96 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-24 overflow-clip\">\r\n    <FocusAutoDemo />\r\n    <FocusManualDemo />\r\n  </div>\r\n</template>\r\n",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web"
    },
    {
      "title": "Web 演示",
      "code": "<template>\r\n  <Focus\r\n    sentence=\"Focus Manually\"\r\n    manual-mode\r\n    :blur-amount=\"5\"\r\n    border-color=\"blue\"\r\n    :animation-duration=\"2\"\r\n    :pause-between-animations=\"1\"\r\n  />\r\n</template>\r\n",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web"
    }
  ],
  "related": [],
  "whenToUse": [
    "标语中需要逐词轮流强调的自动循环动画。",
    "manualMode 下由用户悬停选择聚焦单词的交互式文字展示。"
  ],
  "whenNotToUse": [
    "固定文字的静态高亮标注，改用 text-highlight。",
    "逐字打出文字，改用 reborn-typewriter。"
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "仅 web 端可用。",
    "manualMode 为 true 时仅悬停才聚焦，为 false（默认）时自动循环。",
    "animationDuration 与 pauseBetweenAnimations 单位为秒；blurAmount 单位为像素（默认 5）。",
    "句子通过 sentence prop 传入字符串，按空格拆分为单词，无插槽。"
  ],
  "dependencies": [],
  "install": {
    "cli": "npx reborn-ui@latest add focus"
  },
